# Audio Generation Rules

## Architecture Overview

```
User clicks "Generate"
  └─ soundscapeStore.handleGenerateInternal()
       └─ apiService.generateSounds({ sounds: configs[], ... })
            └─ POST /api/generate-sounds  →  router enqueues
                 └─ sounds_worker.run_sound_generation()  [subprocess]
                      └─ AudioService.generate_sound_file()  [TangoFlux / AudioLDM2]
                           → WAV saved to temp/static/sounds/generated/<session_id>/
  └─ Poll GET /api/sound-generation-status/<generation_id>  every 1500ms
       └─ Streams partial_sounds into generatedSounds as they complete
```

